  "problem": "Noah removes some food from his freezer to defrost. The temperature of the food was $-{4.6}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}.$ After a few hours, the temperature of the food increased by ${10.5}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}.$ What was the temperature of the food after those few hours?",
